  "description": {
   "en": "Kang Juyeong from the English Department attends the semester opening meeting and overhears gossip about Choi Hyun. \"Choi Hyun from the Physical Education Department easily accepts confessions, even from people he's meeting for the first time.\"\n\nAmidst the heated atmosphere of the drinking party, their classmates place a bet of 100,000 won on confessing to Choi Hyun. Feeling uncomfortable with the situation, Juyeong leaves for home, only to come across Choi Hyun, who happens to be breaking up with someone right before his eyes!\n\n\"Date me too!\"\n\nIn fact, Juyeong had secretly harbored feelings for Choi Hyun since high school. Desperate, he stops the fleeing Choi Hyun and blurts out a confession.\n\nFrom that night on, the two become a couple.\n\nCan Juyeong's long-time crush on Choi Hyun turn into a lasting relationship?"
  },
